#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:887
msgid "Newton RTX"
msgstr "Newton RTX"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:325
msgid ""
"The **experimental** Newton RTX visualizer, launched with ``--viz "
"newton_rtx``, uses the OVRTX path-tracer for photorealistic rendering "
"without a Kit process. It is slightly slower than the Newton GL visualizer "
"due to the cost of high-quality RTX rendering."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX 可视化器目前处于 **实验阶段** ，使用 ``--viz newton_rtx`` 启动。它通过 OVRTX "
"路径追踪器实现照片级真实感渲染，无需启动 Kit 进程。由于高质量 RTX 渲染的开销较大，其速度略低于 Newton GL 可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:339
msgid ""
"OVRTX path-traced rendering for photorealistic, physically-based lighting"
msgstr "使用 OVRTX 路径追踪，实现照片级真实感、基于物理的光照"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:343
msgid ""
"The following features are not yet supported and will be added in a future "
"release: visualization markers, live plots, and pause rendering. All are "
"available in the other visualizers. The streaming camera panel's live on-"
"screen preview is also unavailable, but headless streaming capture (e.g. for"
" :class:`~isaaclab.envs.VideoRecorderCfg`) works."
msgstr ""
"以下功能尚未支持，将在后续版本中加入：可视化标记、实时曲线和暂停渲染。其他可视化器均支持这些功能。相机流面板目前也无法在屏幕上实时预览，但支持无界面模式下的相机流采集（例如用于"
" :class:`~isaaclab.envs.VideoRecorderCfg` ）。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:384
msgid ""
"Newton RTX (OVRTX) is a kitless renderer and cannot be used in the same "
"process as Kit (``presets=isaacsim_physx``). ``presets=ovphysx`` is itself "
"kitless and works fine with Newton RTX. Use ``presets=newton_mjwarp,ovrtx`` "
"or ``presets=ovphysx,ovrtx`` with ``--viz newton_rtx``, or switch to ``--viz"
" newton_gl``, ``--viz viser``, ``--viz rerun``, or ``--viz kit`` with a Kit-"
"compatible physics backend."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX（OVRTX）是不依赖 Kit 的渲染器，不能与 Kit（ ``presets=isaacsim_physx`` "
"）在同一进程中使用。 ``presets=ovphysx`` 本身也不依赖 Kit，可以与 Newton RTX 配合使用。请将 ``--viz "
"newton_rtx`` 与 ``presets=newton_mjwarp,ovrtx`` 或 ``presets=ovphysx,ovrtx`` "
"搭配，或者改用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 、 ``--viz viser`` 、 ``--viz rerun`` ；也可以在兼容 Kit "
"的物理后端下使用 ``--viz kit`` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0 source/concepts/visualization.rst:869
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:889
msgid "Rerun"
msgstr "Rerun"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:392
msgid ""
"Like Viser, `Rerun <https://rerun.io/>`_ streams simulation state to a local"
" web server, for remote monitoring, timeline playback, and recording to "
"``.rrd`` files."
msgstr ""
"与 Viser 类似， `Rerun <https://rerun.io/>`_ 将仿真状态传输到本地 Web 服务器，支持远程观察、时间线回放和录制为"
" ``.rrd`` 文件。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:405
msgid "Timeline scrubbing and playback of ``.rrd`` recordings"
msgstr "在时间线上拖动定位，并回放 ``.rrd`` 录制文件"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:406
msgid ""
"**Pause Rendering** and **Reset Episode** controls via the ImGui sidebar"
msgstr "ImGui 侧栏中的 **Pause Rendering** （暂停渲染）和 **Reset Episode** （重置回合）控件"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:410
msgid ""
"The native Play/Pause timeline controls in the Rerun visualizer UI do not "
"work while visualizing a live simulation or training run. They are hidden by"
" default, but Rerun's dock panel UI can still be used to reveal them; when "
"revealed, clicking them has no effect. Use Isaac Lab's own **Pause "
"Rendering** / **Reset Episode** controls instead. The timeline controls are "
"only meaningful when replaying a saved ``.rrd`` recording."
msgstr ""
"在实时查看仿真或训练过程时，Rerun 界面原生的时间线播放/暂停控件不起作用。这些控件默认隐藏，但仍可通过 Rerun "
"的停靠面板界面显示；即使显示出来，点击也不会生效。请使用 Isaac Lab 自身的 **Pause Rendering** （暂停渲染）和 "
"**Reset Episode** （重置回合）控件。时间线控件仅在回放已保存的 ``.rrd`` 文件时有效。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:418
msgid ""
"A highlighted URL is printed to the terminal before training begins. Ctrl-"
"click it to open the viewer, or set ``open_browser=True`` to open it "
"automatically."
msgstr "训练开始前，终端会突出显示访问地址。按住 Ctrl 点击即可打开查看器，也可以设置 ``open_browser=True`` 自动打开。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "RerunVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "RerunVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0 source/concepts/visualization.rst:871
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:890
msgid "Kit"
msgstr "Kit"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:460
msgid ""
"The Kit visualizer embeds Isaac Lab inside a Kit process, providing access "
"to the full Isaac Sim USD stage, RTX renderer, and GUI tooling. It has the "
"highest startup and runtime overhead of the five visualizers."
msgstr ""
"Kit 可视化器将 Isaac Lab 嵌入 Kit 进程，可以访问完整的 Isaac Sim USD 舞台、RTX 渲染器和图形界面工具。在这 5 "
"种可视化器中，它的启动和运行开销最大。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:474
msgid ""
"Direct access to the Isaac Sim USD stage for inspecting and editing prims at"
" runtime"
msgstr "可直接访问 Isaac Sim USD 舞台，在运行时查看和编辑 prim"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:475
msgid "Full Isaac Sim GUI tooling (Property, Layers, and Stage panels)"
msgstr "完整的 Isaac Sim 图形界面工具（Property、Layers 和 Stage 面板）"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:479
msgid ""
"Kit's ImGui-based UI writes an ``imgui.ini`` file, recording window layout "
"(panel positions, docking, collapsed state), to the process working "
"directory. If that is the repository root, it shows up as an untracked file."
" ``imgui.ini`` is already listed in ``.gitignore``; delete it or launch from"
" outside the repository if you would rather it not appear at all."
msgstr ""
"Kit 的 ImGui 界面会在进程的工作目录中写入 ``imgui.ini`` "
"文件，记录窗口布局（面板位置、停靠方式和折叠状态）。如果工作目录是仓库根目录，该文件就会作为未跟踪文件出现。 ``.gitignore`` 已列出 "
"``imgui.ini`` ；如果希望它完全不出现在仓库中，可以删除该文件，或在仓库外的目录中启动程序。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "KitVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "KitVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:517
msgid "Shared Features"
msgstr "共有功能"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:522
msgid "Streaming Camera View"
msgstr "相机流视图"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:524
msgid ""
"The streaming camera view is a live monitoring and debugging tool. It "
"combines ground-truth camera frames from multiple environments (RGB, depth, "
"segmentation, or surface normals) into a single panel. Frames can come from "
"scene camera sensors or follow cameras created by a visualizer. Multiple "
"visualizers can display the same source with different tile selections."
msgstr ""
"相机流视图是一种实时监控和调试工具，将多个环境的相机真值帧（RGB、深度、分割或表面法线）组合到同一个面板中。图像帧可来自场景相机传感器，也可来自可视化器创建的跟随相机。多个可视化器可以显示同一个数据源，各自选择不同的平铺图块。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:546
msgid ""
"Create a follow camera for a moving robot, or select an existing view such "
"as the Galbot task's wrist-mounted and ego cameras. The view is supported in"
" the Kit, Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser visualizers; Newton RTX does not "
"display the panel (experimental). **Kit** opens it as a separate **Streaming"
" View** viewport, which can sit side by side with the default viewport for "
"dual monitoring, and **Newton GL** adds a **Streaming View** HUD section "
"with a **Hide** / **Open** toggle and a source dropdown."
msgstr ""
"可以为运动中的机器人创建跟随相机，也可以选择已有视角，例如 Galbot 任务的腕部相机和机器人第一人称相机。Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和"
" Viser 可视化器支持该视图；Newton RTX 目前不显示此面板，仍处于实验阶段。**Kit** 会打开独立的 **Streaming "
"View** 视口，可与默认视口并排监控；**Newton GL** 则在 HUD 中增加 **Streaming View** 区域，提供 "
"**Hide** / **Open** 开关和数据源下拉框。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:553
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view` for the "
"``VisualizerCfg`` options, display sources, troubleshooting, and step-by-"
"step examples."
msgstr ""
"``VisualizerCfg`` 选项、显示数据源、故障排查和分步示例见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:558
msgid "Visualization Markers"
msgstr "可视化标记"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:560
msgid ""
"Visualization markers draw debug geometry over the scene via "
":class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkers`."
msgstr ""
"可视化标记通过 :class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkers` 在场景上绘制调试用几何图形。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:576
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/how-to/create_visualization_markers` for creating and "
"configuring custom markers."
msgstr "创建和配置自定义标记的方法见 :doc:`/source/how-to/create_visualization_markers` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:578
msgid "There are 2 types of visualization markers:"
msgstr "可视化标记分为两类："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:580
msgid "**Built-in marker types:**"
msgstr "**内置标记类型：**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:582
msgid ""
"Sensor markers: contact hit/no-contact spheres, ray-caster hit points, "
"deformable-object kinematic targets, visuo-tactile contact points"
msgstr "传感器标记：接触/无接触球体、射线投射器命中点、可变形物体的运动学目标，以及视觉触觉接触点"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:584
msgid "Frame markers: coordinate frame with a connecting line"
msgstr "坐标系标记：带有连接线的坐标系"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:585
msgid ""
"Colored arrows (red, blue, green) for direction and velocity indicators"
msgstr "彩色箭头（红、蓝、绿）：表示方向和速度"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:586
msgid "Goal shapes: cuboid, sphere, and multi-state position-goal markers"
msgstr "目标形状：长方体、球体，以及具有多种状态的位置目标标记"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:587
msgid "Center of mass markers"
msgstr "质心标记"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:589
msgid ""
"In the Newton GL visualizer's HUD, built-in marker types that aren't "
"currently active are shown greyed out."
msgstr "在 Newton GL 可视化器的 HUD 中，当前未启用的内置标记类型会显示为灰色。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:592
msgid "**Custom Markers:**"
msgstr "**自定义标记：**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:594
msgid ""
"Defined by individual tasks and MDP terms that instantiate their own "
":class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg`"
msgstr ""
"由各任务和 MDP 项定义，通过实例化各自的 :class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg` 创建"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:596
msgid ""
"Example: the AnymalD velocity command draws its green/blue velocity arrows "
"this way"
msgstr "示例：AnymalD 的速度指令以此方式绘制绿色和蓝色的速度箭头"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:597
msgid ""
"Example: the Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Allegro task defines its own goal marker (a"
" DexCube asset) to show the target cube orientation"
msgstr "示例：Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Allegro 任务定义自己的目标标记（DexCube 资产），用于显示立方体的目标姿态"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:602
msgid ""
"Visualization markers are supported on Kit, Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser; not"
" yet supported on Newton RTX (experimental)."
msgstr "Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 Viser 支持可视化标记；Newton RTX（实验性）暂不支持。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:607
msgid "Live Plots"
msgstr "实时曲线"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:609
msgid "Live plots stream per-step scalar data into the visualizer."
msgstr "实时曲线将每一步的标量数据传输到可视化器中。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:628
msgid ""
"Live Plot windows start hidden or collapsed, except for Rerun, where the "
"Live Plots can be collapsed by selecting the \"eye\" icon. Supported on Kit,"
" Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser; not yet supported on Newton RTX "
"(experimental)."
msgstr ""
"实时曲线窗口默认隐藏或折叠，Rerun 除外；在 Rerun 中，可通过点击“眼睛”图标折叠实时曲线。Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 "
"Viser 支持此功能；Newton RTX（实验性）暂不支持。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:632
msgid ""
"**What's plotted:** per-episode total reward and episode length, plus any "
"active manager term for manager-based environments (e.g. ``joint_pos``)."
msgstr "**绘制的数据：** 每回合的总奖励和回合长度，以及基于管理器的环境中所有已启用的管理器项（例如 ``joint_pos`` ）。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:636
msgid "Video Recording"
msgstr "视频录制"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:638
msgid ""
"Video Recording supports capturing feed from any visualizer view, both "
"interactive and streaming views, and renderer-based sensor data capture."
msgstr "视频录制可以采集任意可视化器视图的画面，包括交互视图和相机流视图，也支持采集渲染器生成的传感器数据。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:660
msgid ""
