"multiple ``VideoRecorderCfg`` entries to record multiple sources at once. "
"When no recorder is configured, ``--viz`` selects the visualizer that "
"``--video`` records:"
msgstr ""
"在命令行中传入 ``--video`` 可快速录制视频；也可以配置多个 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` "
"条目，同时录制多个数据源。未配置录制器时，``--viz`` 决定 ``--video`` 录制哪个可视化器："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:668
