msgstr "报错，因为 Viser 没有本地帧捕获 API"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:680
msgid ""
"Kit, Newton GL, and Newton RTX visualizers can be recorded from; the web-"
"based visualizers Viser and Rerun cannot. Use "
"``VideoRecorderCfg(source=\"sensor:<name>\")`` to record a scene sensor "
