msgstr "配置解析规则"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:759
msgid ""
"Visualizers are resolved from ``--viz`` (comma-separated, e.g. ``--viz "
"kit,newton_gl``) or ``SimulationCfg.visualizer_cfgs`` in code. If ``--viz`` "
"is omitted, the config value is used; ``--viz none`` always disables all "
"visualizers, regardless of config."
msgstr ""
"可视化器由 ``--viz`` （以逗号分隔，例如 ``--viz kit,newton_gl`` ）或代码中的 "
"``SimulationCfg.visualizer_cfgs`` 决定。不传入 ``--viz`` 时使用配置值； ``--viz none`` "
"始终禁用所有可视化器，无论配置如何。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:763
msgid ""
"Add ``--headless`` alongside ``--viz kit`` or ``--viz newton_gl`` to keep "
"that visualizer running without an on-screen window, e.g. as a ``--video`` "
"recording source on a machine without a display."
msgstr ""
"在 ``--viz kit`` 或 ``--viz newton_gl`` 的基础上加入 ``--headless`` "
"，可使该可视化器保持运行而不显示窗口。例如，在没有显示设备的机器上，将其作为 ``--video`` 的录制来源。"

