#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:817
msgid "Partial Visualization"
msgstr "仅显示部分环境"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:819
msgid ""
"Visualizers can be configured to visualize just a subset of environments. "
"This is called partial visualization."
msgstr "可视化器可以配置为只显示部分环境，而非所有环境，这称为部分环境可视化。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:822
msgid ""
"There are 3 fields exposed in the ``VisualizerCfg`` for selecting "
"environments for partial visualization:"
msgstr "``VisualizerCfg`` 提供三个字段，用于选择要显示的环境："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:824
msgid "``max_visible_envs`` caps how many envs are shown."
msgstr "``max_visible_envs`` 限制最多显示多少个环境。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:825
msgid ""
"``visible_env_indices`` explicitly selects the envs to visualize, in the "
"order given. It takes precedence over ``randomly_sample_visible_envs`` and "
"is also capped by ``max_visible_envs``."
msgstr ""
"``visible_env_indices`` 按给定顺序显式指定要显示的环境，优先于 "
"``randomly_sample_visible_envs``，同时仍受 ``max_visible_envs`` 限制。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:827
msgid ""
"``randomly_sample_visible_envs`` (default ``True``): when "
"``visible_env_indices`` is unset and ``max_visible_envs`` is set, enables "
"randomly sampling the selected envs. If disabled, the first "
"``max_visible_envs`` envs are selected."
msgstr ""
"``randomly_sample_visible_envs`` 默认为 ``True``。未设置 "
"``visible_env_indices``、但设置了 ``max_visible_envs`` 时，它决定是否随机抽取环境；关闭后则选择前 "
"``max_visible_envs`` 个环境。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:830
msgid ""
"Also, there is a CLI arg ``--max_visible_envs`` that overrides "
"``VisualizerCfg.max_visible_envs`` for the run."
msgstr ""
"命令行参数 ``--max_visible_envs`` 可在本次运行中覆盖 ``VisualizerCfg.max_visible_envs``。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:834
msgid ""
"By default, selected envs keep their simulated positions, so a random sample"
" or the first envs of a large grid can lie outside the camera view. Choose "
"indices near the camera target, or move ``eye`` and ``lookat``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，选中的环境保留其仿真位置。因此，对于较大的环境网格，随机抽取或选择靠前的环境时，它们可能落在相机视野之外。可以选择靠近相机目标的环境索引，或调整"
" ``eye`` 和 ``lookat``。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:838
msgid "Scene Background"
msgstr "场景背景"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:840
msgid ""
"Kit uses the solid sky-blue background from "
"``VisualizerCfg.background_color`` by default. The Newton visualizers "
"override that default with ``None`` so Newton GL preserves its procedural "
"sky and Newton RTX preserves its native background. For any visualizer, set "
"``background_color`` to ``None`` to preserve the backend's native "
"background, or set an explicit normalized RGB color to override the visible "
"background. Scene lights continue to illuminate objects and contribute "
"reflections:"
msgstr ""
"Kit 默认使用 ``VisualizerCfg.background_color`` 指定的纯天蓝色背景。Newton 可视化器将这一默认值改为 "
"``None``，使 Newton GL 保留其程序化天空，Newton RTX 保留其原生背景。对于任何可视化器，将 "
"``background_color`` 设为 ``None`` 会保留后端的原生背景；也可以设置归一化 RGB "
"颜色，覆盖显示的背景色。场景灯光仍会照亮物体并参与反射："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:854
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:861
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "提示"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:863
msgid "Lowest overhead; increase ``update_frequency`` to skip render calls."
msgstr "开销最低；增大 ``update_frequency`` 可跳过部分渲染调用。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:865
msgid ""
"Newton Warp renderer; use ``max_visible_envs`` to limit the number of "
"rendered environments (see :ref:`visualization-partial-visualization`)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Newton Warp 渲染器；可通过 ``max_visible_envs`` 限制渲染的环境数量，见 :ref:`visualization-"
"partial-visualization` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:868
msgid ""
"Path-traced; highest per-frame cost, use ``--max_visible_envs`` to reduce "
"load."
msgstr "使用路径追踪，单帧开销最高；可通过 ``--max_visible_envs`` 降低负载。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:870
msgid ""
"Web viewer may slow down with many environments; use ``--num_envs`` to "
"reduce load."
msgstr "环境较多时，网页查看器可能变慢；可通过 ``--num_envs`` 降低负载。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:872
msgid ""
"Highest overhead of the five visualizers; reduce ``window_width`` / "
"``window_height`` or use ``--max_visible_envs`` (see :ref:`visualization-"
"partial-visualization`)."
msgstr ""
"五种可视化器中开销最高；可减小 ``window_width`` / ``window_height``，或使用 "
"``--max_visible_envs``，见 :ref:`visualization-partial-visualization` 。"

